+      CausalDiagnosis and runs no FailsafePolicy at all (csia/scenarios.py
+      run_pipeline). The trust latency is the first crossing of that raw
+      series below nav_caution = 0.75. A raw series crossing cannot contain a
+      dwell: the dwell is applied by FailsafePolicy.update AFTER the crossing,
+      between the crossing and the alert. Yet the generator records
+      trust_latency_includes_dwell: True and computes
+      trust_detector_only_latency_s = trust_latency - dwell_up. The committed
+      "detector only" values 7.72 / 2.36 / 2.24 s are therefore 1.0 s too
+      favourable to the trust path; the raw values 8.72 / 3.36 / 3.24 s
+      against CUSUM 2.96 / 1.16 / 0.72 s were ALREADY detector-to-detector.
